Many thanks to the authors for their rebuttal and for addressing all questions raised in my initial review. The single outstanding issue is the release of the codebase. Given that the authors correctly cite the NeurIPS rebuttal guidelines, I have asked the Area Chair for their interpretation of these instructions. If the codebase cannot be supplied, I will unfortunately, be inclined to maintain my score of borderline accept.

